*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*& Report ZMDIK_P016
*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*&
*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
REPORT zmdik_p016.

INCLUDE ZMDIK_P016_001.
INCLUDE ZMDIK_P016_002.

*
*DATA :
*
*
*     sonuc TYPE i.
*
*
*
*PARAMETERS: sayi1 TYPE i,
*            sayi2 TYPE i,
*            islem TYPE char1.
*
*PERFORM hesapla USING sayi1 sayi2.
*
*WRITE sonuc.
**&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
**& Form hesapla
**&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
**& text
**&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
**&      --> SAYI1
**&      --> SAYI2
**&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*FORM hesapla  USING  num1
*                      num2.
*
**CASE islem  .
**  WHEN '+'.
**    sonuc = num1 + num2.
**  WHEN '-'.
**    sonuc = num1 - num2.
**ENDCASE.
*IF islem eq '+'.
*sonuc = num1 + num2.
*ENDIF.
*ENDFORM.
